#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:1
msgid "Krita's Freehand Selection tool reference."
msgstr "Podrobnosti o Kritinem orodju za prostoročni izbor."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Freehand"
msgstr "Prostoročno"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:14
msgid "Outline Select"
msgstr "Oblika orisa"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:19
msgid "Freehand Selection Tool"
msgstr "Orodje Prostoročni izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:21
msgid "|toolselectfreehand|"
msgstr "Orodje Prostoročni izbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Make :ref:`selections_basics` by freely drawing the selection outline around "
"the canvas. Click and drag to draw a border around the section you wish to "
"select."
msgstr ""
"Naredite :ref:'selections_basics' tako, da prosto narišete oris izbora okoli "
"platna. Kliknite in povlecite, da narišete obrobo okoli odseka, ki ga želite "
"izbrati."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:27
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This tool was previously called as the Outline Selection tool. Starting from "
"Krita 4.4.2 release it has been renamed to Freehand Selection Tool. Most of "
"the behavior of the Freehand Selection Tool is common to all other selection "
"tools, please make sure to read :ref:`selections_basics` to learn more about "
"this tool."
msgstr ""
"To orodje je bilo prej imenovano kot orodje za izbiro orisov. Od izdaje "
"Krita 4.4.2 se je preimenoval v Orodje za izbiro proste roke. Večina vedenja "
"orodja za izbiro proste roke je skupna vsem drugim izbirnim orodji, prosimo, "
"da preberete :ref:'selections_basics' in izvedite več o tem orodju."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:32
msgid "Hotkeys and Sticky keys"
msgstr "Hitre in lepljive tipke"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:34
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'add'. You can "
"release the :kbd:`Shift` key while dragging, but it will still be set to "
"'add'. Same for the others."
msgstr ""
":kbd:'Shift +' |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na \"dodaj\". Med "
"vlečenjem lahko spustite ključ :kbd:'Shift', vendar bo še vedno nastavljen "
"na 'dodaj'. Enako za ostale."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:35
msgid ":kbd:`Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'subtract'."
msgstr ":kbd:`Izmenjalka +` |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na »odštej«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:36
msgid ":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to 'replace'."
msgstr ":kbd:`Krmilka +` |mouseleft| nastavi naslednji izbor na »zamenjaj«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:37
msgid ""
":kbd:`Shift + Alt +` |mouseleft| sets the subsequent selection to "
"'intersect'."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Dvigalka + izmenjalka +` |mouseleft| določa, da se naslednji izbor "
"»preseka«."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Holding the :kbd:`Ctrl` key while drawing the selection temporarily makes "
"this tool behave like the Polygon Selection tool and you can then draw "
"straight line selections by just clicking on the canvas."
msgstr ""
"Če držite tipko :kbd:'Ctrl' med risanjem izbora, se to orodje začasno obnaša "
"kot orodje za izbiro polygona, nato pa lahko narišete izbiranje ravnih črt "
"tako, da kliknete na platno."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:43
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Hovering your cursor over the dashed line of the selection, or marching ants "
"as it is commonly called turns the cursor into the move tool icon, which you "
"|mouseleft| and drag to move the selection."
msgstr ""
"Lebdenje kazalca nad črto izbora ali pohodne mravlje, kot se običajno "
"imenuje, spremeni kazalec v ikono orodja za premikanje, ki jo |mouseleft| in "
"povlecite, da premaknete izbor."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:44
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"|mouseright| will open up a selection quick menu with amongst others the "
"ability to edit the selection."
msgstr ""
"|mouseright| odpre hitri meni za izbor, med drugim pa možnost urejanja "
"izbora."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:48
msgid ""
"If you already began making a selection and the polygon mode is active (:kbd:"
"`Ctrl` key is pressed), |mouseright| will undo the last added point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can switch the behavior of the :kbd:`Alt` key to use :kbd:`Ctrl` instead "
"by toggling the switch in Tool Settings in the :ref:`general_settings`"
msgstr ""
"Obnašanje ključa :kbd:'Alt' lahko zamenjate tako, da namesto tega preklopite "
"stikalo v nastavitvah orodja v :ref:'general_settings'"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:60
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This tool is not bound to any Hotkey, if you want to define one, go to :"
"menuselection:`Settings --> Configure Krita --> Keyboard Shortcuts` and "
"search for 'Freehand Selection Tool', there you can select the shortcut you "
"want. Check :ref:`shortcut_settings` for more info."
msgstr ""
"To orodje ni vezan na nobeno Hotkey, če ga želite opredeliti, pojdite na :"
"menuselection:'Nastavitve --> Konfiguriraj Krita --> Bližnjice na "
"tipkovnici' in poiščite »Orodje za izbiro proste roke«, tam lahko izberete "
"želeno bližnjico. Če želite več informacij, shortcut_settings :"
"ref:'shortcut_settings'."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:64
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Možnosti orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:69
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:70
#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:72
msgid "This option is explained in the :ref:`pixel_vector_selection` section."
msgstr "Ta možnost je razložena v razdelku :ref:`pixel_vector_selection`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:71
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Dejanje"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:74
msgid "Anti-aliasing"
msgstr "Glajenje robov"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:74
msgid ""
"This toggles whether or not to give selections feathered edges. Some people "
"prefer hard-jagged edges for their selections."
msgstr ""
"S tem preklopite, ali želite izbiram dati operjene robove. Nekateri imajo "
"raje trde robove za svoje izbore."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/freehand_select.rst:78
msgid "Anti-aliasing is only available on Pixel Selection Mode."
msgstr "Glajenje robov je na voljo le v načinu izbire slikovnih točk."
